#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:2
msgid "Connect Microsoft Teams Meetings to Mattermost"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams Meetings를 OKR.BEST에 연결"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:7
msgid ""
"Start and join voice calls, video calls, and use screen sharing with your"
" team members in Microsoft Teams without leaving Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST를 벗어나지 않고도 Microsoft Teams에서 팀 구성원과 음성 통화, 영상 통화를 시작하고 참여하며 화면 공유를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:10
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "배포"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:12
msgid "Setup starts in Microsoft Azure and ends in Mattermost."
msgstr "설정은 Microsoft Azure에서 시작하여 OKR.BEST에서 끝납니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:15
msgid "Create a Mattermost App in Azure"
msgstr "Azure에서 Mattermost 앱 만들기"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:17
msgid ""
"Sign in to the `Azure portal <https://portal.azure.com>`_ using an admin "
"Azure account."
msgstr "관리자 Azure 계정으로 `Azure 포털 <https://portal.azure.com>`_\\ 에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to `App Registrations "
"<https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_AAD_IAM/ActiveDirectoryMenuBlade/RegisteredApps>`_."
msgstr "`App Registrations <https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_AAD_IAM/ActiveDirectoryMenuBlade/RegisteredApps>`_\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:19
msgid "Select **New registration** at the top of the page."
msgstr "페이지 상단에서 **New registration**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:21
#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:30
msgid "In Azure, create a new app registration."
msgstr "Azure에서 새 앱 등록을 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:24
msgid ""
"Fill out the form with the following values, then select **Register** to "
"submit the form:"
msgstr "다음 값으로 양식을 작성한 다음, 양식을 제출하려면 **Register**\\ 를 선택합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:26
msgid "**Name**: Mattermost Microsoft Teams Meetings Plugin"
msgstr "**Name**: Mattermost Microsoft Teams Meetings Plugin"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:27
msgid "**Supported account types**: Default value (Single tenant)"
msgstr "**Supported account types**: 기본값(Single tenant)"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Redirect URI**: "
"``https://<MM_SITE_URL>/plugins/com.mattermost.msteamsmeetings/oauth2/complete``."
" Replace ``<MM_SITE_URL>`` with your Mattermost server's Site URL."
msgstr "**Redirect URI**: ``https://<MM_SITE_URL>/plugins/com.mattermost.msteamsmeetings/oauth2/complete``. ``<MM_SITE_URL>``\\ 을 OKR.BEST 서버의 사이트 URL로 바꿉니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:33
msgid "Go to **Certificates & secrets** in the left pane."
msgstr "왼쪽 창에서 **Certificates & secrets**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:35
msgid "In Azure, go to Certificates & secrets located in the left pane."
msgstr "Azure에서 왼쪽 창에 있는 Certificates & secrets로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:38
msgid ""
"Select **New client secret > Add**, then copy the new secret in the "
"bottom right corner of the screen. We'll use this value later in the "
"Mattermost System Console."
msgstr "**New client secret > Add**\\ 를 선택한 다음, 화면 오른쪽 하단에 표시된 새 시크릿을 복사합니다. 이 값은 나중에 OKR.BEST 관리자 도구에서 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:40
msgid "In Azure, create a new client secret and copy the value for later."
msgstr "Azure에서 새 클라이언트 시크릿을 생성하고 나중에 사용할 값을 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:43
msgid "Go to **API permissions** in the left pane."
msgstr "왼쪽 창에서 **API permissions**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:45
msgid "In Azure, go to API permissions located in the left pane."
msgstr "Azure에서 왼쪽 창에 있는 API permissions로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:48
msgid ""
"Select **Add a permission** and select **Microsoft Graph** in the right "
"pane."
msgstr "**Add a permission**\\ 을 선택하고 오른쪽 창에서 **Microsoft Graph**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:50
msgid "In Azure, add a permission for Microsoft Graph."
msgstr "Azure에서 Microsoft Graph에 대한 권한을 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:53
msgid ""
"Select **Delegated permissions**, and scroll down to select the "
"``OnlineMeetings.ReadWrite`` permissions. Select **Add permissions** to "
"submit the form."
msgstr "**Delegated permissions**\\ 를 선택하고, 아래로 스크롤하여 ``OnlineMeetings.ReadWrite`` 권한을 선택합니다. 양식을 제출하려면 **Add permissions**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:55
msgid "In Azure, select OnlineMeetings.ReadWrite permissions."
msgstr "Azure에서 OnlineMeetings.ReadWrite 권한을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:58
msgid ""
"Select **Grant admin consent for mattermost** to grant the permissions "
"for the application."
msgstr "애플리케이션에 권한을 부여하려면 **Grant admin consent for mattermost**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:60
msgid "In Azure, grant admin consent permissions for the application."
msgstr "Azure에서 애플리케이션에 대한 관리자 동의 권한을 부여합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:63
msgid "You're all set for configuration inside of the Azure portal."
msgstr "이제 Azure 포털 내에서의 구성이 모두 완료되었습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:66
msgid "Install the Microsoft Teams Meetings integration"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams Meetings 통합 설치"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:68
msgid ""
"Log in to your Mattermost :doc:`workspace </end-user-guide/end-user-"
"guide-index>` as a system admin."
msgstr "시스템 관리자로 OKR.BEST :doc:`워크스페이스 </end-user-guide/end-user-guide-index>`\\ 에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:69
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, from the Product menu |product-list|, select **App "
"Marketplace**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 제품 메뉴 |product-list|\\ 에서 **앱 마켓플레이스**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:100
msgid ""
"Navigate between Channels, collaborative playbooks, and boards using the "
"product menu icon."
msgstr "제품 메뉴 아이콘을 사용해 채널, 공동 플레이북, 보드 사이를 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:70
msgid "Search for or scroll to MS Teams Meetings, and select **Install**."
msgstr "MS Teams Meetings를 검색하거나 스크롤하여 찾은 뒤 **설치**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:71
msgid ""
"Once installed, select **Configure**. You're taken to the System Console,"
" directly to the **MS Teams Meetings** integration page, under "
"**Plugins**."
msgstr "설치되면 **구성**\\ 을 선택합니다. 관리자 도구의 **플러그인** 아래에 있는 **MS Teams Meetings** 통합 페이지로 바로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:75
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.11.2 (ESR) and Mattermost Cloud v10, this plugin is "
"pre-packaged with the Mattermost Server. If your Mattermost deployment is"
" on a release prior to v9.11.2, download the `latest plugin binary "
"release <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-msteams-"
"meetings/releases>`_, and upload it to your server via **System Console >"
" Plugin Management**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v9.11.2(ESR) 및 Mattermost Cloud v10부터 이 플러그인은 OKR.BEST 서버에 사전 패키징되어 있습니다. OKR.BEST 배포가 v9.11.2 이전 릴리스인 경우, `최신 플러그인 바이너리 릴리스 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-msteams-meetings/releases>`_\\ 를 다운로드하여 **관리자 도구 > 플러그인 관리**\\ 를 통해 서버에 업로드하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enable and configure the Microsoft Teams Meetings integration in "
"Mattermost"
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Teams Meetings 통합 활성화 및 구성"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:80
msgid ""
"In Azure, copy the **Application (client) ID** and **Directory (tenant) "
"ID** from the Azure portal."
msgstr "Azure에서 Azure 포털의 **Application (client) ID**\\ 와 **Directory (tenant) ID**\\ 를 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:82
msgid "In Azure, copy the Client ID and Tenant ID values."
msgstr "Azure에서 Client ID와 Tenant ID 값을 복사합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:85
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, go to **System Console > Plugins > MS Teams Meetings** to "
"enable this integration."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 이 통합을 활성화하려면 **관리자 도구 > 플러그인 > MS Teams Meetings**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:87
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, enter the following values in the fields provided. Select "
"**Save** to apply the configuration:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 제공된 필드에 다음 값을 입력합니다. 구성을 적용하려면 **저장**\\ 을 선택합니다:"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Azure - Directory (tenant) ID** - Paste the **Directory (tenant) ID** "
"from the Azure portal."
msgstr "**Azure - Directory (tenant) ID** - Azure 포털의 **Directory (tenant) ID**\\ 를 붙여넣습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Azure - Application (client) ID** - Paste the **Application (client) "
"ID** from the Azure portal."
msgstr "**Azure - Application (client) ID** - Azure 포털의 **Application (client) ID**\\ 를 붙여넣습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Azure - Application (client) Secret** - Copy from the Azure portal "
"(generated in **Certificates & secrets** earlier in these instructions)."
msgstr "**Azure - Application (client) Secret** - Azure 포털에서 복사합니다(이 안내의 앞부분에서 **Certificates & secrets**\\ 에서 생성함)."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:93
msgid ""
"Notify your teams that they can `connect their Microsoft Teams Meetings "
"accounts to Mattermost <#connect-a-microsoft-teams-account-to-"
"mattermost>`__."
msgstr "팀에 `Microsoft Teams Meetings 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결 <#connect-a-microsoft-teams-account-to-mattermost>`__\\ 할 수 있음을 알리세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:96
msgid "Use"
msgstr "사용"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:98
msgid ""
"Users who want to use MS Teams Meetings interconnectivity must connect a "
"Microsoft Teams Meetings account to Mattermost."
msgstr "MS Teams Meetings 상호 연결을 사용하려는 사용자는 Microsoft Teams Meetings 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:100
msgid ""
"Once connected, you'll receive direct messages from the Microsoft Teams "
"Meetings bot in Mattermost for Microsoft Teams Meetings activity."
msgstr "연결되면 Microsoft Teams Meetings 활동에 대해 OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Teams Meetings 봇으로부터 개인 메시지를 받게 됩니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:103
msgid "Connect a Microsoft Teams account to Mattermost"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:105
msgid ""
"Use the `/mstmeetings connect` slash command to connect an MS Teams "
"account to Mattermost."
msgstr "`/mstmeetings connect` 슬래시 명령어를 사용하여 MS Teams 계정을 OKR.BEST에 연결합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:108
msgid "Start a call"
msgstr "통화 시작"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:110
msgid ""
"Start a call either by selecting the video icon in a Mattermost channel "
"or by running the `/mstmeetings start` slash command. Every meeting you "
"start creates a new meeting room in Microsoft Teams."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 채널에서 비디오 아이콘을 선택하거나 `/mstmeetings start` 슬래시 명령어를 실행하여 통화를 시작합니다. 시작하는 모든 회의는 Microsoft Teams에 새 회의실을 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:114
msgid ""
"If you start two meetings less than 30 seconds apart you'll be prompted "
"to confirm that you want to create the meeting."
msgstr "30초 이내에 두 개의 회의를 시작하면 회의를 생성할 것인지 확인하라는 메시지가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:117
msgid "Disconnect a Microsoft Teams account from Mattermost"
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Teams 계정 연결 해제"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:119
msgid ""
"Run the `/mstmeetings disconnect` slash command to disconnect a Microsoft"
" Teams account from Mattermost."
msgstr "`/mstmeetings disconnect` 슬래시 명령어를 실행하여 OKR.BEST에서 Microsoft Teams 계정의 연결을 해제합니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:122
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:124
msgid ""
"We recommend updating this integration as new versions are released. "
"Generally, updates are seamless and don't interrupt the user experience "
"in Mattermost. Visit the `Releases page <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-mscalendar>`__ for the latest release, available "
"releases, and compatibiilty considerations."
msgstr "새 버전이 출시될 때 이 통합을 업데이트할 것을 권장합니다. 일반적으로 업데이트는 매끄럽게 이루어지며 OKR.BEST의 사용자 경험을 방해하지 않습니다. 최신 릴리스, 사용 가능한 릴리스, 호환성 고려 사항은 `릴리스 페이지 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-mscalendar>`__\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:127
msgid "Get help"
msgstr "도움말 보기"

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:129
msgid ""
"Customers with a Mattermost subscription can open a `Mattermost support "
"case <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_. Community "
"deployments can report a bug by opening a GitHub issue against the "
"`Microsoft Teams Notifications plugin <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-msteams-meetings>`_."
msgstr "Mattermost 구독이 있는 고객은 `Mattermost 지원 케이스 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 를 열 수 있습니다. 커뮤니티 배포에서는 `Microsoft Teams Notifications 플러그인 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-msteams-meetings>`_\\ 에 GitHub 이슈를 열어 버그를 신고할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:131
msgid ""
"For questions, feedback, and assistance, join our pubic `Integrations and"
" Apps channel "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_ on the "
"`Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_ for "
"assistance."
msgstr "질문, 피드백, 도움이 필요하면 `Mattermost Community Server <https://community.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 의 공개 `Integrations and Apps channel <https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/integrations>`_\\ 에 참여하세요."

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/microsoft-teams-meetings.rst:133
msgid ""
"Mattermost Team Edition and Free customers can visit the Mattermost "
"`peer-to-peer troubleshooting forum <https://forum.mattermost.com/c"
"/trouble-shoot/16>`_ to access the global Mattermost Community for "
"assistance."
msgstr "Mattermost Team Edition 및 Free 고객은 Mattermost `P2P 문제 해결 포럼 <https://forum.mattermost.com/c/trouble-shoot/16>`_\\ 을 방문하여 글로벌 Mattermost 커뮤니티의 도움을 받을 수 있습니다."

